When striking a hard surface, a '''thunderstone''' creates a deafening bang. Any target who fails a [[fortitude]] save will be [[deaf]] for 5 [[round]]s.
<!-- The above comes from BioWare. Please do not edit mercilessly. -->

All creatures in a {{AoE|medium}} area are affected, except friends (after accounting for the [[PvP setting]]).
The [[difficulty class]] of the save is 15.

